     {
      "as_last_disclosed": "The matter pertains to a GST dispute arising from a departmental show cause notice involving multiple issues. The Company accepted one of the observations relating to input tax credit reversal and discharged the corresponding tax liability. However, the remaining issues were contested before the GST authorities. Following adjudication, an order was passed by the department, against which the Company preferred an appeal before the Commissioner (Appeals).",
